      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my head is killing me right now. i get really bad migraines sometimes but this one feels a bit different. my left arm feels kinda weak and my vision in my left eye is all blurry. is this just a migraine aura or something? im kinda worried but i dont wanna go to the er if i dont have to",
