      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, i appreciate that. but like, driving to the er right now is a huge pain and it's late. honestly the tingle is already starting to fade a little bit since i took the pills. if i just stay in bed and monitor myself for another hour or two, and if it doesn't get worse, is it really that big of a deal? it really feels more like my usual migraine than anything else.",
